WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.997
(Episode 5)

3
00:02.080 --> 00:04.500
You think you're pulling the strings,

4
00:07.660 --> 00:09.380
when you're actually the one being played.

5
00:11.160 --> 00:12.680
The more clueless you are,

6
00:18.420 --> 00:19.820
the harder you dance to their tune.

7
00:27.800 --> 00:29.300
Please, save Kataoka

8
00:30.360 --> 00:32.377
and Odajima.

9
00:32.460 --> 00:34.837
I told you, I have no obligation to step in.

10
00:34.920 --> 00:35.960
But.

11
00:36.460 --> 00:38.120
Kataoka did this for our clan.

12
00:41.220 --> 00:43.740
You made this mess. Why should I clean it up?

13
00:56.100 --> 00:57.620
Look at how many of us there are.

14
00:58.640 --> 01:00.320
What can you do with just one knife?

15
01:01.360 --> 01:03.220
You don't stand a chance.

16
01:05.220 --> 01:06.520
You're right.

17
01:08.560 --> 01:09.580
However,

18
01:12.620 --> 01:14.420
it's more than enough to kill me.

19
01:16.300 --> 01:17.777
What are you doing?

20
01:17.860 --> 01:19.840
Take us to your boss.

21
01:20.380 --> 01:23.440
If you don't, he'll slit my throat.

22
01:24.580 --> 01:27.390
If we die, the Kirii Clan will retaliate.

23
01:28.160 --> 01:31.237
And whoever's pulling the strings will have their plans ruined.

24
01:31.320 --> 01:33.440
Right after I kill you, I'll follow you to the grave.

25
01:33.720 --> 01:34.929
Good.

26
01:35.012 --> 01:36.640
That's my wife.

27
01:37.620 --> 01:39.420
Let's see if you've got the guts!

28
01:40.960 --> 01:42.640
Don't underestimate

29
01:43.220 --> 01:44.740
the resolve of an ex-yakuza!

30
01:56.220 --> 01:57.520
Stop.

31
02:33.779 --> 02:35.017
Well done.

32
02:35.100 --> 02:37.157
- Impressive, isn't he? - Yes.

33
02:38.784 --> 02:40.786
Don't use karate to pick fights, okay?

34
02:40.869 --> 02:41.869
Okay.

35
02:45.490 --> 02:46.680
You'll get him next time.

36
02:47.220 --> 02:49.603
I could never stand that guy.

37
02:50.860 --> 02:53.380
He beat me at everything.

38
02:53.940 --> 02:56.480
I could never tell what was going on in his head.

39
02:58.080 --> 02:59.137
And yet,

40
03:00.305 --> 03:01.364
my old man

41
03:02.224 --> 03:04.100
always favored him over me.

42
03:05.727 --> 03:07.496
Go kill Kataoka.

43
03:13.151 --> 03:14.820
Is Kataoka still alive?

44
03:17.280 --> 03:18.532
Make it quick.

45
03:19.820 --> 03:21.120
Oh, right.

46
03:22.220 --> 03:23.980
You're the boss now.

47
03:24.996 --> 03:27.349
Huh? Are you mocking me?

48
03:28.680 --> 03:29.980
Huh?

49
03:32.960 --> 03:34.260
What? What's your problem?

50
03:45.860 --> 03:47.160
Those two and us,

51
03:48.080 --> 03:49.380
we go way back.

52
03:51.580 --> 03:53.000
Letting civilians get killed

53
03:54.440 --> 03:56.060
would be a disgrace to the clan.

54
03:58.140 --> 03:59.737
Please, save Kataoka

55
03:59.820 --> 04:01.560
and Odajima.

56
05:18.900 --> 05:20.985
"The Journey To Killing You Season 2"

57
05:32.460 --> 05:33.760
Ihashi-san.

58
05:55.240 --> 05:56.540
You...

59
05:57.380 --> 05:58.700
You look familiar.

60
06:01.960 --> 06:03.420
Where have I seen you before?

61
06:09.703 --> 06:12.055
I hate idiots and I hate wasting time.

62
06:14.300 --> 06:15.600
So I'll make this quick.

63
06:20.960 --> 06:22.740
The only reason you're still breathing

64
06:23.480 --> 06:25.527
is because keeping you alive was more profitable.

65
06:26.780 --> 06:27.929
However,

66
06:29.540 --> 06:32.440
since keeping you alive no longer serves a purpose,

67
06:42.140 --> 06:43.540
I'll just kill you.

68
06:51.786 --> 06:53.054
Time to die.

69
07:10.055 --> 07:11.348
Kataoka-san.

70
07:12.307 --> 07:13.600
Kataoka-san!

71
07:15.352 --> 07:17.192
What would you do if something happened to me?

72
07:20.160 --> 07:21.560
I won't let that happen.

73
07:22.780 --> 07:24.680
This time, I'll protect you no matter what.

74
08:19.740 --> 08:21.320
Looks like you're having fun.

75
08:22.000 --> 08:23.400
Count me in.

76
08:25.520 --> 08:27.300
Kanto's Largest Syndicate,

77
08:27.841 --> 08:29.259
Chairman of the Kotoku-kai,

78
08:30.260 --> 08:31.594
Hikari Hanao.

79
08:39.519 --> 08:41.955
Looks like you guys are having a blast.

80
08:44.340 --> 08:47.540
What brings a retired civilian to a place like this?

81
08:48.862 --> 08:51.182
Came all the way from Okinawa to do some city sightseeing?

82
09:02.083 --> 09:03.268
Finally, I get to see you.

83
09:15.740 --> 09:16.517
Hana-chan!

84
09:16.600 --> 09:18.517
Kin-chan!

85
09:18.600 --> 09:21.228
Long time no see, Kin-chan.

86
09:21.311 --> 09:23.657
You went straight and ran off to Okinawa without a word.

87
09:23.740 --> 09:24.897
Sorry about that.

88
09:24.980 --> 09:28.296
You guys were in the middle of a turf war with Kansai back then. Looked pretty busy.

89
09:28.320 --> 09:31.117
Yeah, it was a real mess,

90
09:31.200 --> 09:32.057
but you still could've given me a heads-up.

91
09:32.140 --> 09:32.997
Don't be a stranger.

92
09:33.080 --> 09:34.596
We've known each other since preschool.

93
09:34.620 --> 09:36.777
Right, the Peach Class.

94
09:36.860 --> 09:39.180
The Peach Class... that takes me back!

95
09:41.720 --> 09:42.776
Looks like you're doing well for yourself.

96
09:42.800 --> 09:44.340
Couldn't be better.

97
09:45.760 --> 09:47.087
Hey, Hana-chan.

98
09:47.170 --> 09:49.276
I've been hearing some bad rumors about the main family.

99
09:49.300 --> 09:51.127
Hmm? Like what?

100
09:51.210 --> 09:54.810
Jacking up the tribute fees out of nowhere, and trying to take over the Kirii-gumi's turf?

101
09:56.260 --> 09:58.427
- Turf? - Yeah.

102
09:58.510 --> 09:59.510
What turf?

103
10:01.780 --> 10:03.137
Besides,

104
10:03.220 --> 10:06.597
the tribute fees haven't changed since my old man's time.

105
10:06.680 --> 10:08.200
Huh? They haven't?

106
10:10.340 --> 10:11.370
Then

107
10:11.940 --> 10:13.330
who's behind this?

108
10:28.086 --> 10:29.379
Ihashi.

109
10:30.500 --> 10:31.940
Why did you kidnap Kin-chan?

110
10:38.020 --> 10:39.277
Chairman,

111
10:39.360 --> 10:40.265
there's a reason for this.

112
10:40.348 --> 10:42.400
Was it to keep Kin-chan and me from meeting?

113
10:44.686 --> 10:46.020
Please, let me explain.

114
10:51.940 --> 10:53.060
Explain?

115
10:54.400 --> 10:55.400
Yes.

116
10:56.322 --> 10:57.448
An explanation.

117
11:12.680 --> 11:14.080
Whoa, hey.

118
11:14.580 --> 11:16.880
I was born into a yakuza family, you know.

119
11:18.469 --> 11:21.055
I've been playing with guns since preschool.

120
11:22.080 --> 11:23.440
You really think you can beat me?

121
11:25.880 --> 11:27.180
Hey.

122
11:27.800 --> 11:28.800
Run, run!

123
11:28.855 --> 11:30.100
Hurry up!

124
11:39.760 --> 11:41.217
Wait.

125
11:41.300 --> 11:42.369
Please, wait!

126
11:42.452 --> 11:43.620
Chairman!

127
11:48.260 --> 11:49.620
Hey, get in here.

128
11:55.360 --> 11:57.360
Quit stalling.

129
12:04.060 --> 12:05.183
I beg you.

130
12:05.266 --> 12:06.720
Please don't kill me.

131
12:11.720 --> 12:12.437
Seriously,

132
12:12.520 --> 12:15.818
cooking the syndicate's books and then begging for your life?

133
12:18.080 --> 12:20.000
Have you no shame?

134
12:25.500 --> 12:26.800
You...

135
12:30.540 --> 12:32.500
Weren't you killed and encased in concrete?

136
12:34.740 --> 12:36.040
That was a lie.

137
12:37.090 --> 12:38.250
A lie?

138
12:41.380 --> 12:43.263
This guy spilled everything.

139
12:45.120 --> 12:47.020
Cooking the books to embezzle money,

140
12:47.558 --> 12:51.312
using it to buy up land in Awakuma City and pay off street thugs...

141
12:55.190 --> 12:57.870
He said you were the one behind it all.

142
13:04.600 --> 13:06.000
He was a tough nut to crack.

143
13:07.360 --> 13:09.220
Took us forever to get him to talk.

144
13:11.920 --> 13:14.268
Seems like he's really terrified of you.

145
13:24.380 --> 13:25.780
Now I remember.

146
13:27.160 --> 13:29.000
You used to be with the Kirii-gumi.

147
13:30.977 --> 13:32.787
You were one of my dad's men.

148
13:37.066 --> 13:40.610
(Summer 1998)

149
13:46.160 --> 13:47.368
Boss Kataoka.

150
13:48.578 --> 13:49.097
I got what you asked for.

151
13:49.180 --> 13:51.177
Oh, Ihashi. Thanks for the trouble.

152
13:51.260 --> 13:52.260
Not at all.

153
13:53.000 --> 13:54.850
Today's my boy's birthday.

154
13:55.710 --> 13:56.897
Congratulations.

155
13:56.980 --> 13:58.540
We haven't been able to see each other,

156
13:59.255 --> 14:00.548
so this is the first time.

157
14:01.060 --> 14:02.216
I'm celebrating it with him.

158
14:03.780 --> 14:05.397
Here's some premium sushi, take a look.

159
14:05.480 --> 14:06.317
How should I know?

160
14:06.400 --> 14:07.440
Come on, please take it...

161
14:07.513 --> 14:08.514
Don't be like that.

162
14:10.970 --> 14:12.890
- Good work. - It's the boss.

163
14:14.180 --> 14:16.310
- Good work today, Boss. - Oh, Kataoka.

164
14:17.230 --> 14:18.520
Out of the way!

165
14:21.770 --> 14:23.029
Die!

166
14:46.135 --> 14:47.445
You bastard!

167
14:51.265 --> 14:53.300
Kin... Kinji...

168
14:54.890 --> 14:56.187
Kataoka!

169
14:56.270 --> 14:57.097
Are you alright?

170
14:57.180 --> 14:58.270
Stay with me!

171
14:59.200 --> 15:00.500
Kataoka.

172
15:02.320 --> 15:03.880
Hang in there, Kataoka!

173
15:04.940 --> 15:06.420
Kataoka!

174
15:10.740 --> 15:13.840
I... I...

175
15:14.660 --> 15:16.600
You kidnapped me instead of killing me.

176
15:17.917 --> 15:19.637
Was that to repay the debt you owed my dad?

177
15:20.440 --> 15:22.680
You wanted to spare my life and send me back to Okinawa.

178
15:40.920 --> 15:42.220
Ihashi,

179
15:44.540 --> 15:45.840
you're done for.

180
16:11.320 --> 16:14.937
Kataoka-san, Odajima-san, are you guys okay?

181
16:15.020 --> 16:18.720
Come at me, all of you!

182
16:19.560 --> 16:20.770
Huh?

183
16:31.020 --> 16:32.210
Ihashi...

184
16:35.570 --> 16:36.570
What?

185
16:40.540 --> 16:41.797
Yo.

186
16:41.880 --> 16:43.497
Managing Director, and the young guy.

187
16:43.580 --> 16:44.880
Kataoka-san.

188
16:46.480 --> 16:47.500
Oh.

189
16:48.080 --> 16:49.130
From the Kirii-gumi?

190
16:51.130 --> 16:52.477
The Chairman of the main family!

191
16:52.560 --> 16:53.560
What?

192
16:58.260 --> 16:59.560
What's going on here?

193
17:00.960 --> 17:02.147
Anyway,

194
17:02.230 --> 17:03.600
everything's settled now.

195
17:04.440 --> 17:05.580
Thanks for coming.

196
17:06.150 --> 17:07.597
Right...

197
17:07.680 --> 17:08.680
Yes, sir.

198
17:12.440 --> 17:13.574
By the way,

199
17:14.780 --> 17:16.080
is this the one?

200
17:17.740 --> 17:18.740
Yeah.

201
17:32.360 --> 17:33.967
Kin-chan,

202
17:34.050 --> 17:35.880
your taste in women sure has changed.

203
17:37.140 --> 17:38.347
Come on.

204
17:38.430 --> 17:41.010
You used to go for the busty, bombshell types, right?

205
17:44.620 --> 17:46.280
He may not be busty,

206
17:50.270 --> 17:51.790
but he's got serious guts.

207
17:52.530 --> 17:53.960
He's the best wife I could ask for.

208
18:11.000 --> 18:12.300
I'm starving.

209
18:14.560 --> 18:15.610
Boss.

210
18:16.260 --> 18:17.720
Boss...

211
18:18.550 --> 18:19.680
You came.

212
18:21.470 --> 18:22.760
More or less.

213
18:24.120 --> 18:25.480
It's our family's mess, after all.

214
18:26.040 --> 18:27.380
I'm here to see how it plays out.

215
18:32.440 --> 18:33.740
You're still alive, huh?

216
18:35.720 --> 18:37.020
Thanks for your concern.

217
18:49.820 --> 18:52.539
The heads of the Kotoku-kai and Kirii-gumi are sworn enemies.

218
18:52.953 --> 18:57.093
You said a war would break out if they ever met...

219
18:58.540 --> 18:59.840
This is bad.

220
19:56.110 --> 19:57.671
Some things never change.

221
19:59.420 --> 20:00.720
See, the two of them...

222
20:01.340 --> 20:02.860
back when they were in kindergarten...

223
20:07.960 --> 20:09.934
- Kei-chan, give me your finger! - Huh?

224
20:11.480 --> 20:12.837
Pinky swear, make a vow.

225
20:12.920 --> 20:16.797
Tell a lie and you swallow a thousand needles.

226
20:16.880 --> 20:18.740
There, our pact is sealed!

227
20:19.360 --> 20:21.777
Wait, wasn't that just a pinky swear?

228
20:21.860 --> 20:25.997
Our two families are uniting, so it's a blood pact!

229
20:26.080 --> 20:27.437
Uniting?

230
20:27.520 --> 20:29.440
They said it's just like getting married.

231
20:31.340 --> 20:34.720
Which means you and I are getting married, Kei-chan!

232
20:36.318 --> 20:37.737
I don't get it.

233
20:53.800 --> 20:57.760
Ever since then, Hana-chan has been proposing to Keito.

234
21:00.460 --> 21:01.760
They're still kissing...

235
21:09.477 --> 21:12.288
Kei-chan, I missed you so much.

236
21:14.060 --> 21:16.580
You never show up to the executive meetings.

237
21:17.280 --> 21:18.800
It's always that old guy instead.

238
21:21.280 --> 21:22.907
Still, it's so good to finally see you.

239
21:23.980 --> 21:25.201
Kei-chan.

240
21:25.284 --> 21:26.744
Do you want a castle?

241
21:26.827 --> 21:27.827
Huh?

242
21:28.380 --> 21:30.420
I'm about to get my hands on one.

243
21:30.980 --> 21:32.300
I'll give it to you as a present.

244
21:35.020 --> 21:36.320
So...

245
21:38.140 --> 21:39.440
Let's get married.

246
21:40.150 --> 21:41.150
Kei-chan.

247
21:41.750 --> 21:42.750
Oh.

248
21:46.370 --> 21:47.840
I'll kill you.

249
21:48.850 --> 21:50.050
Kei-chan?

250
21:51.100 --> 21:52.457
I'm gonna kill you!

251
21:52.540 --> 21:53.540
Huh?

252
21:54.271 --> 21:55.564
This means all-out war!

253
21:57.640 --> 21:59.418
What war, Kei-chan?!

254
22:00.152 --> 22:01.152
Let go of me!

255
22:02.530 --> 22:06.907
Wait, I'm dead serious! I'll give you the whole castle!

256
22:06.990 --> 22:08.552
Who the hell wants a castle?!

257
22:10.720 --> 22:12.020
Then how about a tank?

258
22:14.480 --> 22:15.977
Or do you just want me?

259
22:16.060 --> 22:17.560
You're the last thing I want!

260
22:18.940 --> 22:20.140
Who else is there besides me?!

261
22:20.214 --> 22:21.460
Hey, Kei-chan!

262
22:22.216 --> 22:23.593
Is there someone else?!

263
22:23.676 --> 22:24.676
Knock it off!

264
22:25.886 --> 22:27.722
Hold him back, hold him back!

265
22:27.805 --> 22:29.282
I'll follow you to the ends of the earth!

266
22:29.306 --> 22:30.386
Good, keep him right there.

267
22:38.000 --> 22:40.000
(Finale Preview)

268
22:42.500 --> 22:44.200
I will protect the Boss.

269
22:46.100 --> 22:47.400
I swear,

270
22:48.260 --> 22:49.560
I won't let you die.

271
22:50.500 --> 22:51.800
As long as I'm with you,

272
22:53.700 --> 22:55.560
we're together, in life or in death.

273
22:57.042 --> 22:58.377
This time,

274
22:59.550 --> 23:01.230
I'll protect you, no matter what.

275
23:02.320 --> 23:03.465
If...

276
23:04.300 --> 23:05.593
forever really exists.
